  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "A flask contains hydrogen and oxygen in the ratio of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;by mass at temperature <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. The ratio of average kinetic energy per molecule of hydrogen and oxygen respectively is :",
    "image": null
  },
